# MOONWITNESS XV — TODO v2 REBUILD AUDIT & CUTOVER DECISION

> **UNCOMMITTED RECOMMENDATION** · October 26, 2026 · remote `main` examined at `05eff5d68571c49240b04ea19dc52082eab6ad28` · does not include unpublished local work. This document is **not** a replacement source of truth until a controlled adoption. Do not change GitHub on the strength of this report alone.

## Executive verdict

**REBUILD THE PLANNING STRUCTURE**, not the implementation, IDs of canonical domain records, or accepted evidence. V1's 203 IDs are a historical audit register; V2 should become the single active executable queue only after all legacy tasks are mapped, old evidence preserved and present code inspected. Avoid a second active checklist while AI agents continue coding.

