## CI and evidence requirements

At current head, [CI 40301899408](https://github.com/bjo163/moonwitnessxv/actions/runs/40301899408) passed. Subsequent work must re-run relevant negative-case tests and CI; a passing build alone is not evidence of authorization, privacy, rights, deletion propagation, native media stream, actual human review or real sourced world telemetry.

## Cutover approach

1. **Draft**: review `MOONWITNESS_XV_TODO_V2_CANDIDATE_2026-10-26.md`, no repository changes.
2. **Observe**: re-fetch `main`, list in-flight worker patches/branches; path ownership freeze limited to the planning register.
3. **Reconcile**: generate 203/203 crosswalk, sign off 0 orphan/0 collision and collect evidence.
4. **Integrate**: coordinator archives previous register and makes only one `TODO.md` authoritative, reconciles README/BLUEPRINT and ADR errata in one ordered change set.
5. **Validate**: test parser, dependency acyclicity, unique IDs, no duplicate canonical owner, Git-relative doc links, CI and rollback.
6. **Resume**: agents consume disjoint READY packets with exclusive leases; only coordinator updates TODO and pushes `main` serially.

